# Possible Tower Defense — project core

- Genre: fixed-path tower defense (NOT maze-building). Towers never on path tiles.
- Stack: Vite + TypeScript + Canvas 2D. Keep modules under `src/game/` and helpers in `src/shared/`.
- UX: BCI-first — large buttons, click-to-place, no drag-and-drop, no hover-only controls.
- Balance data lives in `src/game/constants.ts` and `src/game/levels.ts` — tune there first.
- Art is procedural in `src/game/renderer.ts`; log any external assets in `docs/ASSETS.md`.
- Do not commit secrets; use `.env.example` only for future config.
